    </div>
    
    <div class="text-content">
      <p>Eco-conscious dog owners are now a major and growing buyer segment. They read labels. They ask questions on social media. They share bad reviews when a brand claims sustainability without proof. GRS certified recycled polyester fill, GOTS certified organic cotton lining, PFAS-free waterproofing | these are the certifications that let a brand answer those questions with documentation, not marketing language.</p>
      
      <p>SDF provides the full certification documentation stack with every order. OEKO-TEX test reports, GOTS chain-of-custody certificates, GRS transaction certificates, and REACH compliance declarations are all available before bulk shipment. Your compliance team and your marketing team both get what they need.</p>
      
      <p>Founder Chowdhury Remon donates 80% of SDF profits to charity. A dog coat brand that chooses SDF is not just sourcing a product | it is choosing a manufacturing partner with a social mission embedded in its business model. Read more at <a href="/about/" style="color: var(--color-accent);">/about/</a> and <a href="/sustainability/" style="color: var(--color-accent);">/sustainability/</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

