    <div style="max-width: 800px;">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 class="faq-item__question">What is the minimum order for custom dog coats?</h3>
        <p class="faq-item__answer">The minimum order is 300 pieces per style. For sampling, you can order 1 to 5 physical coats per design to evaluate fit, fabric, and finish before committing to bulk production.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 class="faq-item__question">How long does dog coat sampling take?</h3>
        <p class="faq-item__answer">Sample production takes 7 to 14 calendar days from design approval and fabric confirmation. Physical samples are shipped to your address for fitting evaluation across your target breed and size range.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 class="faq-item__question">What dog coat styles can I manufacture with low MOQ?</h3>
        <p class="faq-item__answer">All styles are available from 300 pieces | waterproof parkas, raincoats, fleece-lined jackets, puffer coats, softshell jackets, drying coats, cooling vests, anxiety wraps, and hi-vis safety coats. Each style has its own 300-piece MOQ.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 class="faq-item__question">Are the waterproofing materials safe for dogs?</h3>
        <p class="faq-item__answer">Yes. SDF uses PFAS-free DWR waterproofing with documented chemical composition. All outer fabrics are OEKO-TEX Standard 100 tested, covering more than 100 harmful substances. Test reports are available with every order.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 class="faq-item__question">Can I manufacture dog coats with a harness hole?</h3>
        <p class="faq-item__answer">Yes. A D-ring harness access hole is built into the standard pattern for every dog coat style. You can specify the exact placement and opening type during the sampling stage.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 class="faq-item__question">What certifications apply to dog coats?</h3>
        <p class="faq-item__answer">OEKO-TEX Standard 100 applies to all fabrics. GOTS certification is available for organic cotton constructions. GRS certification applies to recycled polyester fill and shell fabrics. All three certifications include documentation for your compliance and marketing teams.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 class="faq-item__question">Can I get my dog coat brand private labelled from 300 pieces?</h3>
        <p class="faq-item__answer">Yes. Private label is standard on all orders regardless of quantity. This includes custom woven labels, printed care labels, hang tags, branded poly bags, and custom shipper boxes.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 class="faq-item__question">What is the bulk lead time for dog coats?</h3>
        <p class="faq-item__answer">Bulk production is completed within 40 days from sample approval and purchase order confirmation. The on-time delivery rate is 98% across all product categories.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 class="faq-item__question">Do you manufacture sustainable or recycled dog coats?</h3>
        <p class="faq-item__answer">Yes. Recycled polyester fill with GRS certification and GOTS organic cotton lining are both available. PFAS-free waterproofing is standard. Every sustainability claim is backed by a named certification with audit documentation.</p>
